        "description": "<p>Focsd Hide Author Names replaces displayed author names with a generic label such as &#8220;Staff&#8221;.<br />\nIt can also disable author links, hide author bios, and redirect author archive pages.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code></li>\n<li>Activate the plugin</li>\n<li>Configure under Settings <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-exclude-emoji\">→</span> Reading</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Restored author bio hiding and WP_User filtering.</li>\n<li>Added option to disable author links cleanly.</li>\n<li>Translation-ready strings throughout.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Hide displayed author names and optionally disable author archives.",
